{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2d288eaa-8664-4822-89d1-302679d0e88b",
    "name": "AI Project Planning - Microservices",
    "description": "## **This Postman collection is for the AI-Powered Project Planning Platform, which consists of 7 independent microservices built with Spring Boot.**\n\nThe platform allows users to submit project ideas, validate subscriptions, assign team members, create tasks, and track progress automatically.\n\n### **The collection is organized by service in the correct execution order:**\n\n1. Payment Service — subscribe and validate user subscription\n    \n2. User Service — register and login\n    \n3. Team Service — add and manage team members\n    \n4. Planning Service — create project plans and fetch full details with team member\n    \n5. Progress Service — view progress reports and project summary\n    \n6. Task Service — create tasks, assign to members, and update status\n    \n7. Idea Service — submit an idea and trigger AI analysis which validates payment synchronously then sends the idea to RabbitMQ asynchronously for the Planning Service to process\n    \n\n**Before running: start RabbitMQ using Docker and run each service using ./gradlew bootRun**",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "50453238",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/50453238-2d288eaa-8664-4822-89d1-302679d0e88b?source=collection_link"
  },
